  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-Mec 302.04 Term of Business Entity Licensure. An initial business entity license issued under this chapter shall be issued for 2 years and shall expire on the last day of January.\n\nSource. #10648, EMERGENCY RULE, eff 7-25-14, EXPIRES: 1-21-15; ss by #10761, INTERIM, eff 1-21-15, EXPIRES: 7-20-15; ss by #10847, eff 7-1-15 (from Saf-Mec 301.05)",
